    "detail": {
      "id": 1320703,
      "name": "[Ellen] Hunter's Fin",
      "desc": "Every 15s, Ellen applies a <color=#FFFFFF>Hunting</color> mark that lasts for 15s to a random enemy. When hitting an enemy marked with <color=#FFFFFF>Hunting</color> with <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color> or Swift Scissors/Charged Scissor Strike during <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack: Arctic Ambush</color>, using Basic Attack <IconMap:Icon_Normal> or Special Attack <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> again allows Ellen to <color=#2BAD00>consume nothing</color> and <color=#2BAD00>immediately trigger the skill again</color> with <color=#2BAD00>its CRIT DMG increased by 25%</color>. If the target is defeated, Ellen will instantly apply a <color=#FFFFFF>Hunting</color> mark to the next enemy. When she has <color=#FFFFFF>Flash Freeze Charge</color>, each extra point of <color=#FFFFFF>Flash Freeze Charge</color> <color=#2BAD00>increases Ellen's ATK by 5%</color>. This effect lasts for 10s and stacks up to 9 times. The duration of each stack is calculated separately.",
